# roadmap 6.F5: fantasy_draft.lua in ladder mode with ladder_probe.lua: one player (initials
# BBB) drafts a pair for his side, and the side wins two games in a row (the probe puts it
# ahead in the fourth quarter). The first game is a new ladder: player 1 takes Danny Manning
# and, when his pick timer runs out, Stacey Augmon. The game's own pick of the computer's
# opponent is the first team of team_orders not beaten: Dallas, then Detroit once Dallas is
# beaten. The second game replays the saved ladder without drafting, with the same pair on
# court (places 0 and 1). full_game.lua pays each game through all four quarters (in free
# play a start buys only part of a game, and the draft holds the starts).
script dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/fantasy_draft.lua
extra ladder_probe.lua ../../dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/full_game.lua
game nbajamte nbajamse
frames 92001
run mode=1 timer=10
nolog error
once fantasy draft: 1 drafters, 2 picks
once fantasy draft: pick 1, player 1 takes Danny Manning for P1
once fantasy draft: pick 2, player 1 takes Stacey Augmon for P2
once fantasy draft: a new ladder in slot 1 for team 1
once fantasy draft: ladder opponent Dallas, the stock game's next: Dallas
once tipoff 1 places 0 1
once fantasy draft: ladder: beat Dallas
log fantasy draft: replaying the last draft, P1 Danny Manning, P2 Stacey Augmon
once fantasy draft: ladder slot 1, game 2 for team 1, 1 of 27 teams beaten
once fantasy draft: ladder opponent Detroit, the stock game's next: Detroit
once tipoff 2 places 0 1
once fantasy draft: ladder: beat Detroit
